# Scraper guardrails (`src/scraper.py`)

## Selector strategy (the critical bit)

- **The results table is located by column header text**, not by CSS classes or `nth-child`. This keeps us resilient to portal CSS churn.
- `HEADER_TITLE`, `HEADER_PIRKIMO_ID`, `HEADER_PUBLISHED`, `HEADER_ORG` are the only "magic strings" we touch when the portal rewrites headers. Edit the constants, not `_find_header_indices`.
- The "Ieskoti" (Search) button click has **4 fallbacks** (+ `Enter` press). Don't remove any of them.

## Playwright hygiene

- **Always** use the `with sync_playwright() as p:` context; call `context.close()` and `browser.close()` in a `finally` block.
- `context = browser.new_context(locale="lt-LT")` — supports Lithuanian date/number formatting on the portal.
- Use `page.set_default_timeout(timeout_ms)` instead of passing `timeout=` to every call.
- Use `wait_for_function(...)` with JS regex (`Pirkimo\\s*ID`), not `wait_for_selector(".some-class")`.

## Data validation

- `pirkimo_id` must match `^\d+$` (see `_extract_rows`). A non-numeric value = skip the row.
- URL normalization — **only** through `_absolute_url(href)`. No ad-hoc `BASE_URL + href`.
- `inner_text() or ""` + `.strip()` — never assume Playwright returns non-None.

## Resilience

- `search_keywords_for_cycle` — **vienas** `sync_playwright()` + **vienas** `chromium.launch()` per
  `run_cycle`; kiekvienam keyword naujas `browser.new_context(locale="lt-LT")`.
- `search_keyword` — plonas wrapper vienam keyword (kviečia `search_keywords_for_cycle([kw])`).
- Retry iki `SEARCH_MAX_ATTEMPTS` (default **3**) su `SEARCH_RETRY_DELAY_SEC` (default **15** s):
  portal klaida → naujas context, tas pats browser; browser crash → relaunch.
- `deadline` (optional, `run_cycle` perduoda `started + cycle_max_seconds - 90`
  kai `cycle_max_seconds > 150`): prieš naują bandymą ir prieš 15 s sleep
  grąžina `None`, kad export + `health.json` spėtų prieš tėvo kill. Greitas
  ciklas (~20 s, default 600) deadline nepaliečia.
- Launch args: `--disable-gpu`, `--no-zygote`, `--disable-dev-shm-usage`; `--single-process` kai
  `CHROMIUM_SINGLE_PROCESS=true` (Railway 512 MB) **arba** vienas fallback po `pthread_create` /
  `Resource temporarily unavailable` (EAGAIN). `TargetClosedError` vienas fallback'o netriggerina.

## Don't

- Don't switch `sync_playwright` to `async_playwright` — APScheduler's `BlockingScheduler` is synchronous.
- Don't add a request/response cache — each cycle must be fresh and independent.
- Don't reuse **context** across keywords ar retry (cookie/session bleed) — browser per ciklą OK,
  context visada naujas.

## When the portal changes

1. Open `https://viesiejipirkimai.lt/epps/prepareAdvancedSearch.do?type=cftFTS` manually.
2. Verify the `#Title` input selector — if it's no longer `#Title`, update `page.fill("#Title", ...)`.
3. Verify column headers — update the `HEADER_*` constants.
4. Run `python run_once.py` with `HEADLESS=false` in `.env` to watch the browser.

## Diagnostika (Playwright / Railway)

- **`TargetClosedError` ant `launch`:** ne portalas — tikrinti ar ciklas naudoja **vieną** browser
  (`Ieskau N keyword(s) vienu browser` loge); `health.json` → `last_search_ok`.
- **`pthread_create (11)` / `Resource temporarily unavailable`:** PID/gijų limitas, ne OOM.
  Didelis `cgroup_memory_limit_mb` + ciklas ~2 s ≠ liepos 6× launch (~64 s). Fallback į
  `--single-process`; Railway: `CHROMIUM_SINGLE_PROCESS=true` + Restart, ne Memory slider.
- **`GitHub push OK` be paieškos:** export veikia iš SQLite — skraperis gali būti miręs; žiūrėti
  `search_fail_streak`, ne tik `last_export_ok`.
- **`cgroup_memory_limit_mb` / `cgroup_pids_max` / `nproc_soft`:** loguojami ciklo pradžioje
  (`src/agent.py`); žemas RAM (<1024 MB) reikalauja `CHROMIUM_SINGLE_PROCESS=true`; didelis
  RAM + `pthread_create` → PID/gijos.
- **Po ilgo outage:** pirmas sėkmingas ciklas gali siųsti daug `[NEW]` (backlog į DB);
  jei eilutės jau `mark_seen` — `nauju nera`, laiško nėra.
- **`--single-process` tarp keyword:** pirmas `rasta`, antras `new_page` / browser
  closed (1/3) + 15 s retry — tikėtina, ne launch EAGAIN. Outage tik jei nėra
  antro `rasta`.
